\end_inset

: 
\begin_inset Formula $x^0\sim x^1 \Leftrightarrow x^0\succcurlyeq x^1$
\end_inset

 y 
\begin_inset Formula $x^1\succcurlyeq x^0$
\end_inset

 (
\begin_inset Formula $x^0$
\end_inset

